<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>PropertyHub</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/about.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/7.3.1/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body>

    <%- include("../partials/navbar") %>


        <div id="about">

            <div id="about-text">

                <p>ABOUT PROPERTYHUB</p>

                <h1>Find A Place You Can Call Home</h1>

                <p>
                    PropertyHub makes it easier to discover,
                    compare and find properties that fit your
                    lifestyle, budget and future.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div id="about-content">

                <div>
                    <h2>Who We Are</h2>

                    <p>
                        PropertyHub is a property platform created
                        to make finding and listing properties
                        simple and convenient.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Whether you're looking for a new home,
                        an apartment or a property to invest in,
                        PropertyHub helps you find suitable
                        properties in different locations.
                    </p>
                </div>


                <div>
                    <h2>What We Do</h2>

                    <p>
                        We provide a platform where property
                        buyers can discover properties while
                        property owners can list their properties
                        for potential buyers.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Our goal is to make the property search
                        process easier, faster and more convenient.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>


            <div id="about-features">

                <div>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-house"></i>

                    <h3>Find Properties</h3>

                    <p>
                        Discover properties that match
                        your needs.
                    </p>
                </div>


                <div>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass"></i>

                    <h3>Easy Search</h3>

                    <p>
                        Search properties by location,
                        type and price.
                    </p>
                </div>


                <div>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>

                    <h3>Simple & Secure</h3>

                    <p>
                        Manage your properties and account
                        from one place.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>

        </div>


        <%- include("../partials/footer") %>

</body>
</html>